{"seq":1,"slug":"own-license-cost-benefit","title":"自持牌照成本收益决策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-payment-license-compliance/own-license-vs-partner/own-license-cost-benefit","wordCount":2321,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"自持牌照成本收益决策\">自持牌照成本收益决策</h1><p>「自己拿牌还是借牌」在讨论中经常被简化成一个成本数字的对比，但真正决定这个决策的是三组不同性质的量：<strong>一次性沉没投入、持续性的固定成本、以及放弃掉的灵活性</strong>。前两组是会计问题，第三组是战略问题，而第三组通常被严重低估。</p>\n<p>本篇给出一个可计算的决策框架，并明确回答一个具体问题：<strong>在什么条件下自持牌在财务上根本不成立。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-三类成本与一条盈亏平衡线\">核心概念：三类成本与一条盈亏平衡线</h2><p>把自持牌与合作的差异拆成三列，决策就变成一次朴素的多期比较。需要提醒的是，这一章讨论的是<strong>非银行支付机构</strong>的成本结构——监管机构本身也在持续研究这类主体的风险与监管缺口，例如金融稳定理事会在 2024 年 12 月发布了针对非银行支付服务提供者的监管与监督最终建议，说明这类主体的监管成本与要求仍在演进中，立项评估时不能假设现行要求长期不变（<a href=\"https://www.fsb.org/work-of-the-fsb/payments-and-settlements/cross-border-payments/\">FSB: Cross-Border Payments</a>）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成本类别</th>\n<th>自持牌模式下发生什么</th>\n<th>合作模式下发生什么</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>一次性投入</td>\n<td>牌照申请费与法律费、系统改造（存管、报送、对账）、初始资本金（部分为<strong>冻结</strong>而非消耗）、保证金</td>\n<td>集成成本、商务尽调，通常只有自持牌的零头</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>持续性成本</td>\n<td>合规团队、外部审计、监管报送、年度续期、资本金维持与补充、保证金占用</td>\n<td>按笔或按比例的通道成本，随业务量线性增长</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>灵活性</td>\n<td>受制于牌照的<strong>活动边界</strong>与<strong>辖区边界</strong>，产品变更需先变更授权</td>\n<td>受制于合作方的产品能力与终止权，切换有迁移成本</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>控制权</td>\n<td>自主掌握资金路径、定价、客户关系、以及牌本身（可转让的资产）</td>\n<td>资金与客户身份通常在持牌方一侧，关系被中介化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>盈亏平衡的本质是：自持牌的<strong>固定成本</strong>要由<strong>通道成本节省额</strong>来摊平。设自持牌的年化持续成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>f</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_f</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，一次性投入按 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 年摊销为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>，合作的单位通道成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 而自持牌的单位资金成本为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>c</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c&#x27;</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，年业务量为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>，则自持牌在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 年内更优的条件是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(A + C_f) &lt; (c - c&#x27;) \\cdot Q \\cdot n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0519em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8019em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个不等式给出了决策的实际形状：<strong>业务量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 是唯一的主导变量</strong>。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 小，左侧的固定项永远压不住右侧的薄价差；当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 跨过某个点，右侧线性增长会迅速超过固定成本。这也解释了为什么同一家公司在早期用合作模式、规模化后转自持牌，是两个都正确、但只在各自阶段正确的决策。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[年度可服务交易量 Q] --&gt; B[估算单位价差]&#10;  B --&gt; C[计算自持牌固定成本]&#10;  C --&gt; D{节省额是否超过固定成本?}&#10;  D --&gt;|是| E[自持牌在财务上成立]&#10;  D --&gt;|否| F[合作模式更优]&#10;  E --&gt; G{活动边界是否允许自持牌覆盖全部业务?}&#10;  G --&gt;|否| H[混合模式&lt;br/&gt;核心市场自持牌 + 长尾市场合作]&#10;  G --&gt;|是| I[全量自持牌]&#10;  F --&gt; J{规模增长后 Q 是否将跨过盈亏点?}&#10;  J --&gt;|是,1-2 年内| K[提前启动申请&lt;br/&gt;审批周期是硬约束]&#10;  J --&gt;|否| L[维持合作&lt;br/&gt;周期性重估]\">graph TD\n  A[年度可服务交易量 Q] --&gt; B[估算单位价差]\n  B --&gt; C[计算自持牌固定成本]\n  C --&gt; D{节省额是否超过固定成本?}\n  D --&gt;|是| E[自持牌在财务上成立]\n  D --&gt;|否| F[合作模式更优]\n  E --&gt; G{活动边界是否允许自持牌覆盖全部业务?}\n  G --&gt;|否| H[混合模式&lt;br/&gt;核心市场自持牌 + 长尾市场合作]\n  G --&gt;|是| I[全量自持牌]\n  F --&gt; J{规模增长后 Q 是否将跨过盈亏点?}\n  J --&gt;|是,1-2 年内| K[提前启动申请&lt;br/&gt;审批周期是硬约束]\n  J --&gt;|否| L[维持合作&lt;br/&gt;周期性重估]</pre><p>图里有两个容易被忽略的分支。<code>审批周期是硬约束</code> 指的是牌照申请通常需要数月到一年以上，加上系统改造时间，<strong>决策必须按「业务量跨过盈亏点的时点」倒推，而不能等到跨过再启动</strong>。<code>混合模式</code> 则是最常见的现实答案：核心市场自持牌保障利润与产品自主权，长尾市场用合作模式覆盖，避免为小市场独立承担全部固定成本。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一次性投入的构成与常见低估项\">一次性投入的构成与常见低估项</h2><p>申请费与法律费是显性的，真正容易被低估的是下面三项。</p>\n<h3 id=\"资本金是占用而非消耗\">资本金是占用而非消耗</h3><p><strong>资本金与保证金的性质不同。</strong> 初始资本金在多数辖区是<strong>实缴并需持续维持</strong>的自有资金——它不消耗，但被占用，成本是资金的机会成本而非金额本身。保证金则可能是存入监管或指定账户、在特定条件下才可释放的资金。财务建模时应当把它算作「占用成本 = 金额 × 资金成本率」，而不是算作「费用」。这也是为什么牌照密集的集团会出现「牌照把资本金锁在多个辖区、无法合并使用」的问题——见 <a href=\"../license-maintain-ops/multi-region-license-structure\">多区域牌照主体架构协同</a>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"系统改造的规模\">系统改造的规模</h3><p><strong>系统改造的规模被低估。</strong> 自持牌意味着自己成为资金存管与监管报送的责任主体，需要建设的不是「接入一个支付通道」，而是存管账户体系、日终对账引擎、监管报送批处理、以及审计可读的完整台账。这一块的工作量属于第 3 章的范畴，其持续维护成本往往超过初始建设成本。</p>\n<h3 id=\"合规人力是阶梯式的\">合规人力是阶梯式的</h3><p><strong>持续性合规人力是阶梯式的。</strong> 合规不是可以按比例缩放的资源：达到某个业务量后，监管会要求独立的内审职能、专门的合规负责人、以及外部年度审计。这些都表现为固定成本台阶，而不是线性增长。</p>\n<h2 id=\"什么情况下自持牌根本不成立\">什么情况下自持牌根本不成立</h2><p>有四种情形下，无论业务量多大，自持牌都不是可行选项——识别它们可以省掉大量无效调研：</p>\n<h3 id=\"主体资格受限\">主体资格受限</h3><ol>\n<li><strong>市场要求持牌主体为本地法人且限制外资控制。</strong> 此时唯一的路径是合资、收购持牌主体、或继续用合作模式。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"活动集合无单一牌照覆盖\">活动集合无单一牌照覆盖</h3><ol start=\"2\">\n<li><strong>业务所需活动集合超出该辖区任何单一牌照的许可范围。</strong> 例如同时需要收单、发行电子货币、以及跨境汇款且无一张牌照覆盖全部——此时要么申请多张牌，要么把部分活动交给合作方，即混合模式。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"存管要求使自建路径不可行\">存管要求使自建路径不可行</h3><ol start=\"3\">\n<li><strong>资金存管要求使自建资金路径在任何形态下都不经济。</strong> 当辖区要求客户资金全额存放于中央银行或指定机构、且对账户开立主体有资格限制时，非持牌主体连「存放」这个动作都无法完成。</li>\n</ol>\n<h3 id=\"预期业务量长期低于盈亏点\">预期业务量长期低于盈亏点</h3><ol start=\"4\">\n<li><strong>预期业务量长期低于盈亏点。</strong> 这是最纯粹的一条：如果 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 在可预见的年限内无法让右侧超过左侧，自持牌就是把固定成本换成了更大的固定成本。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>反过来说，自持牌在最应该被考虑的三种情形下被错误放弃：<strong>业务量已经跨过盈亏点、监管对非持牌主体提供同类服务开始收紧、以及合作方的通道成本与终止权已经实质性影响产品路线图</strong>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三种被错误放弃的时机\">三种被错误放弃的时机</h3><p>前两种情形的共同特征是<strong>外部条件已经变化但内部决策没有重估</strong>：业务量增长了，或者监管环境收紧了，但团队仍在按「规模太小不值得」的旧结论行事。第三种情形是最容易被察觉但最常被拖延的：产品路线图被合作方的能力边界反复削减时，说明合作的期权价值已经耗尽。这三条判据的作用是给出「什么时候必须重估」的触发条件，而不是等到下一年度规划。</p>\n<h2 id=\"决策工件的落地形式\">决策工件的落地形式</h2><p>把上面的框架写成一份可评审的决策记录，比写成一篇分析报告更有用——因为它可以被后续复核、被量化假设更新、被审计追问时提供依据。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;decision&quot;: &quot;own_license_vs_partner&quot;,&#10;  &quot;market&quot;: &quot;SG&quot;,&#10;  &quot;required_activities&quot;: [&quot;cross_border_money_transfer&quot;, &quot;merchant_acquisition&quot;],&#10;  &quot;option_own_license&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;one_time&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;application_and_legal&quot;: &quot;estimate&quot;,&#10;      &quot;system_build&quot;: { &quot;safeguarding_accounts&quot;: true, &quot;reconcile_engine&quot;: true, &quot;reg_reporting&quot;: true },&#10;      &quot;capital_required&quot;: { &quot;amount&quot;: &quot;per_activity_tier&quot;, &quot;nature&quot;: &quot;paid_in_and_maintained&quot; },&#10;      &quot;security_deposit&quot;: { &quot;amount&quot;: &quot;per_activity_tier&quot;, &quot;nature&quot;: &quot;restricted_until_release_conditions&quot; }&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;recurring_annual&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;compliance_headcount&quot;: &quot;step_function&quot;,&#10;      &quot;external_audit&quot;: true,&#10;      &quot;regulatory_reporting&quot;: &quot;ongoing&quot;,&#10;      &quot;capital_maintenance&quot;: &quot;opportunity_cost_only&quot;&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;constraints&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;activity_boundary&quot;: &quot;license-scoped&quot;,&#10;      &quot;jurisdiction_boundary&quot;: &quot;SG&quot;,&#10;      &quot;approval_lead_time_months&quot;: &quot;hard_constraint&quot;&#10;    }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;option_partner&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;integration_one_time&quot;: &quot;estimate&quot;,&#10;    &quot;unit_cost&quot;: { &quot;basis&quot;: &quot;per_transaction_or_bps&quot;, &quot;scales_with_volume&quot;: true },&#10;    &quot;constraints&quot;: { &quot;product_roadmap&quot;: &quot;partner_dependent&quot;, &quot;termination&quot;: &quot;partner_controlled&quot; }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;breakeven_rule&quot;: &quot;(unit_cost_saving) * annual_volume * horizon_years &gt; one_time_amortized + recurring_annual&quot;,&#10;  &quot;review_cadence&quot;: &quot;quarterly_volume_recheck&quot;,&#10;  &quot;mixed_mode_candidate&quot;: &quot;core_market_own + long_tail_partner&quot;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"decision\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"own_license_vs_partner\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"market\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SG\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"required_activities\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cross_border_money_transfer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"merchant_acquisition\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"option_own_license\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"one_time\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"application_and_legal\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"estimate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"system_build\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"safeguarding_accounts\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"reconcile_engine\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"reg_reporting\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"capital_required\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"amount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"per_activity_tier\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"nature\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"paid_in_and_maintained\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"security_deposit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"amount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"per_activity_tier\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"nature\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"restricted_until_release_conditions\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"recurring_annual\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"compliance_headcount\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"step_function\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"external_audit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"regulatory_reporting\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ongoing\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"capital_maintenance\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"opportunity_cost_only\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"constraints\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"activity_boundary\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"license-scoped\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"jurisdiction_boundary\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SG\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"approval_lead_time_months\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"hard_constraint\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"option_partner\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"integration_one_time\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"estimate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"unit_cost\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"per_transaction_or_bps\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"scales_with_volume\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"constraints\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"product_roadmap\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"partner_dependent\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"termination\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"partner_controlled\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"breakeven_rule\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"(unit_cost_saving) * annual_volume * horizon_years > one_time_amortized + recurring_annual\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"review_cadence\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"quarterly_volume_recheck\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"mixed_mode_candidate\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"core_market_own + long_tail_partner\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这份记录里最关键的字段是 <code>approval_lead_time_months: hard_constraint</code> 与 <code>review_cadence</code>：前者把「审批周期不可压缩」这件事固化进决策，后者保证决策不因业务量变化而失效。把所有 <code>estimate</code> 换成实际数字的过程，就是尽调本身。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>决策的本质是<strong>固定成本 vs 线性价差</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>f</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>c</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\" lspace=\"0em\" rspace=\"0em\">′</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">(A + C_f) &lt; (c - c&#x27;) \\cdot Q \\cdot n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0019em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7519em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">′</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>，其中业务量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span> 是主导变量。</li>\n<li>三类成本必须分开建模：一次性投入、持续性固定成本、以及被放弃的灵活性（活动边界与辖区边界的收窄）。</li>\n<li>资本金是<strong>占用</strong>而非消耗，应按机会成本建模；系统改造与合规人力的真实规模常被低估，且合规人力呈<strong>固定成本台阶</strong>而非线性。</li>\n<li>四种情形下自持牌不成立：外资控制受限、所需活动集合无单一牌照覆盖、存管要求使自建路径不可行、预期业务量长期低于盈亏点。</li>\n<li><strong>审批周期是不可压缩的硬约束</strong>，决策必须按业务量跨过盈亏点的时点倒推；混合模式（核心市场自持牌 + 长尾市场合作）是最常见的现实解。</li>\n<li>决策应落成可复核的记录（含假设、约束、重估节奏），而不是一次性分析报告。定下模式后，具体的合作法务形态选择见 <a href=\"licensed-psp-agency-model\">持牌 PSP/银行合作与代理模式</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"自持牌照成本收益决策","id":"自持牌照成本收益决策"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：三类成本与一条盈亏平衡线","id":"核心概念-三类成本与一条盈亏平衡线"},{"level":2,"text":"一次性投入的构成与常见低估项","id":"一次性投入的构成与常见低估项"},{"level":3,"text":"资本金是占用而非消耗","id":"资本金是占用而非消耗"},{"level":3,"text":"系统改造的规模","id":"系统改造的规模"},{"level":3,"text":"合规人力是阶梯式的","id":"合规人力是阶梯式的"},{"level":2,"text":"什么情况下自持牌根本不成立","id":"什么情况下自持牌根本不成立"},{"level":3,"text":"主体资格受限","id":"主体资格受限"},{"level":3,"text":"活动集合无单一牌照覆盖","id":"活动集合无单一牌照覆盖"},{"level":3,"text":"存管要求使自建路径不可行","id":"存管要求使自建路径不可行"},{"level":3,"text":"预期业务量长期低于盈亏点","id":"预期业务量长期低于盈亏点"},{"level":3,"text":"三种被错误放弃的时机","id":"三种被错误放弃的时机"},{"level":2,"text":"决策工件的落地形式","id":"决策工件的落地形式"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"牌照范围与业务活动边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-payment-license-compliance/payment-license-map/license-scope-activity-bound"},"next":{"title":"持牌 PSP/银行合作与代理模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-payment-license-compliance/own-license-vs-partner/licensed-psp-agency-model"}}